{"id":"fact-example-001","type":"code_quirk","fact":"Example: The UserService caches results for 5 minutes, so updates may not appear immediately in queries.","recommendation":"Use cache invalidation after writes, or query with { fresh: true } option.","confidence":"medium","provenance":[{"source":"agent","reference":"discovered during debugging","date":"2026-01-15"}],"tags":["caching","user-service"],"affectedFiles":["src/lib/services/user.service.ts"],"affectedServices":["UserService"],"createdAt":"2026-01-15T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-01-15T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"fact-iqr-001","type":"code_quirk","fact":"estimators_internal::iqr() (inline, called by compute_all_estimators → ensemble path) and iqr_impl (Rcpp export in iqr.cpp, called by iqr_scaled()) are completely independent code paths. Changes to one do NOT affect the other's performance or behavior.","recommendation":"When gating changes to estimators_internal::iqr(), use the ensemble proxy benchmark (scale_robust(x, n_boot=50)), not the iqr_impl size-sweep gate. When gating changes to iqr_impl, the ensemble proxy is not informative.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"agent","reference":"iqr-opt OPT-I8 gate analysis","date":"2026-03-22"}],"tags":["iqr","ensemble","architecture","benchmarking"],"affectedFiles":["src/estimators_internal.h","src/iqr.cpp"],"affectedServices":["iqr_scaled","scale_robust"],"createdAt":"2026-03-22T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-22T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
{"id":"fact-iqr-002","type":"code_quirk","fact":"IQR uses static constexpr int IQR_INLINE_LIMIT = 256 (local to iqr.cpp), NOT the shared ROBSCALE_MICRO_BUFFER_SIZE = 128 used by mad, gmd, and rob_scale. IQR_INLINE_LIMIT=256 deliberately pushes the NOINLINE boundary above n=129 (~6µs), where call overhead is disproportionate. Confusing the two constants will silently reintroduce unnecessary NOINLINE dispatch at n=129.","recommendation":"When modifying the iqr NOINLINE boundary, edit IQR_INLINE_LIMIT in src/iqr.cpp only. Do not use ROBSCALE_MICRO_BUFFER_SIZE for IQR.","confidence":"high","provenance":[{"source":"agent","reference":"iqr-opt OPT-I1+I2","date":"2026-03-22"}],"tags":["iqr","inline","noinline","stack","performance"],"affectedFiles":["src/iqr.cpp","src/robscale_config.h"],"createdAt":"2026-03-22T00:00:00Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-22T00:00:00Z","usageCount":0,"helpfulCount":0,"outdatedReports":0}
